| `SL_d(ℤ)` two-generated (`conder2025generating`) | ✓ not needed: not used (`S`, `T` at `d = 2`: Mathlib's `SL2Z_generators`) |
| (unstated) model richness | ⚠ strengthened: `IsRichToroidalModel` (C-31), needed |
| "universal EGF family" | ⚠ weakened (DEC-141): the ε-form `IsUniversalFamilyEps volume 𝓕` (DEC-141) |
